# Walk with the Ancestors: when the one target it chose (Black Lotus in Bot1's graveyard) is illegal as the spell resolves, the whole spell is countered
# on resolution and does nothing (CR 608.2b): nothing returns and nothing is discovered. Bot2 sacrifices Tormod's Crypt (it ends in Bot2's graveyard) in response to exile Bot1's
# graveyard, Lotus with it. Bot1's library keeps Grizzly Bears on top (discover 4 would have found it), and Walk goes to the graveyard.

